# ⚠ THIS IS THE PACKAGE'S OWN IGNORE FILE, AND IT EXISTS BECAUSE THE EXPORT NEEDS ONE.
#
# When this package moved under `packages/wyrd/` on 2026-08-31 the workspace `.gitignore` stayed at
# the repo root — correct for the workspace, and out of reach of `release.mjs`, whose export root is
# this directory. The public repo is a real repo and needs its own ignores, so it gets them here
# rather than by the export reaching upward out of its own root, which would make the allow-list a
# statement about a directory it does not govern.
#
# Nested ignore files are additive in git, so this does not fight the workspace root's copy; it
# repeats the entries that are true of this package specifically.
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ⚠ THE LOCKFILE IS DELIBERATELY ABSENT FROM THE PUBLIC REPO, AND UNTIL 2026-08-31 THAT WAS ONLY
# TRUE IN A COMMENT. `release.mjs` states as an accepted cost that "the public repo now carries no
# lockfile, so a consumer building from source resolves fresh within the `package.json` ranges" —
# and a tracked `package-lock.json` was sitting there the whole time. The real lockfile is the
# WORKSPACE ROOT's; a package-level copy exported here would pin a consumer's build to whatever
# this machine resolved.
#
# ⚠ Removing it once was not enough: the export only ADDS and OVERWRITES, so a deletion is a
# one-time act while `git add .` is forever. The ignore is what makes it stay gone.
package-lock.json

npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/

# Carries registry auth tokens. Never commit it.
.npmrc

.env
.env.local

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.idea/
